From: OE-Alliance <oe-alliance@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] AudioEngine: add DVB hardware audio and STB driver settings

Use libstbplayer for PCM and native compressed audio with hardware A/V
clock feedback. Preserve timestamped packets and bound decoder retries.
Expose receiver audio/video modes in system and playback settings using
existing driver interfaces. Inherit Enigma2 state by default and optionally
retain separate Kodi preferences. Restore the previous driver state on
exit and confirm video mode changes.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [STB hardware integration]

---
